  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=Join us on Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools 是 Mekanism 的官方附属模组，为各种 Mekanism 材质以及部分原版材质添加了工具和护甲。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>为以下材质提供护甲、盾牌和工具（包括帕塞尔（斧镐铲三合一工具））：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青铜</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青金石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">锇</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">精炼萤石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">精炼黑曜石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">钢</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">此外还包含适用于原版工具类型的帕塞尔工具：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">木头</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">石头</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">铁</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">金</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">钻石</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模块链接：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>文档</strong>&nbsp;可在 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方维基</a> 上找到，该维基由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 自豪地托管！文档仍在完善中，如果您有能力，请多多贡献！</p>\n<p><strong>源代码&nbsp;</strong>可在 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 上获取！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持团队&nbsp;</strong>通过 Patreon：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持团队&nbsp;</strong>通过 Ko-fi：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>",
